  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-08-15T21:49:46.832Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "There are way too limited options when it comes to chatbox languages in VR Chat. For example writing with people from my own Country of Norway is not fun. As i have to copy paste Norwegian words that have the use of æ Æ + ø Ø + å Å.\n\nIm sure many different language keyboards would be appriciated alot. As especially when the letters dont have the use of the english alphabet.\n\nThe whole entire UI language doesnt have to be changed to implement a simple Language keyboard.\n\nShould Also have different Language Keyboards for the Chat Box as an option instead of needing to change the whole language across the UI.\n\nThank you for reading!",
